<programme start="20261018060000 +0000" stop="20261018072900 +0000" channel="C-SPAN 2"><title lang="en">The History of the Space Program</title><desc lang="en">In 1957, the beeps from Sputnik, a small Russian satellite, sent the USSR &amp; US into a space race. Teasel Muir-Harmony of the Air &amp; Space Museum chronicles the history of space travel and how the U.S. landed on the Moon and how we&apos;re going back in 20.</desc><category lang="en">Specials</category><category lang="en">Documentary</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p32235130_b_v12_aa.jpg"/></programme>
