<programme start="20261017160000 +0000" stop="20261017193000 +0000" channel="CBS Sports"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Florida Atlantic at Army</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Army Black Knights host the Florida Atlantic Owls for an American Athletic Conference (AAC) battle at Michie Stadium. Florida Atlantic sits in fourth place in the conference behind Caden Veltkamp&apos;s 1,427 passing yards, while Army is sixth.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261017193000 +0000" stop="20261017230000 +0000" channel="CBS Sports"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">UNLV at Air Force</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Air Force Falcons host the UNLV Rebels in Mountain West action at Falcon Stadium. The Falcons rely on Evan Medders to command the triple-option after Liam Szarka&apos;s season-ending injury, while the Rebels counter with playmaker Jackson Arnold.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261017230000 +0000" stop="20261018023000 +0000" channel="CBS Sports"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Nevada at North Dakota State</sub-title><desc lang="en">The North Dakota State Bison host the Nevada Wolf Pack in Week 7 action at the Fargodome. North Dakota State looks to Nathan Hayes under center, while Nevada relies on Carter Jones after guiding the offense to 645 passing yards this season.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261018023000 +0000" stop="20261018060000 +0000" channel="CBS Sports"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Fresno State at San Diego State</sub-title><desc lang="en">The San Diego State Aztecs clash with the Fresno State Bulldogs in a Pac-12 Conference game. San Diego State relies on Javion Kinnard in the ground game, while Fresno State counts on Jayden Mandal after his 1,252 passing yards and eight touchdowns.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
