<programme start="20261017011700 +0000" stop="20261017014700 +0000" channel="Inuyasha"><title lang="es">Inuyasha LT</title><sub-title lang="es">El Lugar en Donde nos Conocimos</sub-title><desc lang="es">En el presente, Kagome siente que Inuyasha ha elegido a Kikyo, y decide nunca volver al pasado después de devolver los fragmentos de Shikon Jewel.</desc><credits><actor>Alfredo Basurto (Sesshomaru)</actor><actor>Ana Lobo (Aome Higurashi)</actor><actor>Enzo Fortuny (Inuyasha)</actor><actor>Gabriel Gama (Miroku)</actor><actor>Georgina Sánchez (Kikyo)</actor><actor>Liliana Barba (Sango)</actor></credits><date>20011029</date><category lang="es">Anime</category><category lang="es">Anime Action &amp; Adventure</category><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">1.20.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S02E21</episode-num><rating><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://images.pluto.tv/series/64a83d8df56d820013a09168/tile_1769549401567.jpg?fill=blur&amp;fit=fill&amp;fm=jpg&amp;h=660&amp;q=75&amp;w=660"/></programme>
