<programme start="20261017225600 +0000" stop="20261017232500 +0000" channel="JoJo’s Bizarre Adventure"><title lang="es">JoJo&apos;s Bizarre Adventure</title><sub-title lang="es">Hielo blanco</sub-title><desc lang="es">Giorno y Mista llegan a Venecia para recuperar el disco de datos, pero el Stand White Ice de Ghiaccio frustra su misión congelando todo lo que tienen a la vista.</desc><credits><actor>Kensho Ono</actor><actor>Yuichi Nakamura</actor><actor>Junichi Suwabe</actor><actor>Kohsuke Toriumi</actor><actor>Daiki Yamashita</actor><actor>Junya Enoki</actor><actor>Ray Chase</actor><actor>Sean Chiplock</actor><actor>Kellen Goff</actor><actor>Katsuyuki Konishi</actor></credits><date>20190215</date><category lang="es">Anime</category><category lang="es">Anime Series</category><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">3.18.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S04E19</episode-num><rating><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://images.pluto.tv/series/65bd42b9b65b870013b0bd02/tile_1769467681643.jpg?fill=blur&amp;fit=fill&amp;fm=jpg&amp;h=660&amp;q=75&amp;w=660"/></programme>
