<programme start="20261017020000 +0000" stop="20261017040000 +0000" channel="NBC Sports Network"><title lang="en">Premier League Soccer</title><sub-title lang="en">Liverpool vs. Manchester City</sub-title><desc lang="en">Liverpool (2-3-0) hosts Manchester City (5-0-0) in the Premier League. Man City has won three straight in the series, including a 4-0 FA Cup win in April. Sixth-place Liverpool beat Bournemouth 1-0 on an Alexander Isak goal in its last match.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Soccer</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p3605402_b_v12_bj.jpg"/></programme>
