<programme start="20261016120000 +0000" stop="20261016130000 +0000" channel="Sci 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">How the Universe Works</title><sub-title lang="en">Curse of the White Dwarf</sub-title><desc lang="en">White dwarfs are small, dead stars with a dangerous side, and they are capable of exploding into supernovas and destroying planets; new research suggests these mysterious phenomena may be the key to understanding the universe itself.</desc><category lang="en">Science</category><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p8078107_b_v12_bh.jpg"/></programme>
